hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"168","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Falan ko bakhsh de, hidayatyaftaon mein us ka darja buland kar; peeche rehne wali [nasl] mein us ka janasheen ban; hamein aur use bakhsh de ae Rabbul-aalamin; us ki qabr kushada kar aur us mein us ke liye nur de. [Mayyat ke liye dua; naam ki jagah zikr kare]"
